graph\" >Zero Carrier Fighter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　SUBWEAPON: Drop-type Small Bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　FORMATIONI: Wide Formation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　BOMBBBBBB: God Wind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123570/extras/a4eb30700eca789d80f0410140fab30c.avif?t=1774406751\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinden J7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　SUBWEAPON: Large Rocket Shell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　FORMATIONI: Assault Formation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　BOMBBBBBB: True Samurai Sword</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123570/extras/54f01036acd652186ed5ae1e79030c07.avif?t=1774406751\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p>",
